+## Obligations on Other Nodes
 
-Retrieval must distinguish a usable current state from unresolved review work. Exactly how those states are represented remains part of the open choice.
+- **tablet-sync** keeps, for each visit it holds, the revision ID its local copy was fetched or created from, generates revision IDs locally, submits chained offline edits oldest first, and can show a worker that their submission is competing or was superseded by a resolution.
